<span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e5b78bfb3887990\" href=\"?note=1e5b78bfb3887990\" title=\"17-df-horn-formula\">17-df-horn-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3979795456a966f2\" href=\"?note=3979795456a966f2\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product-preservation\">17-df-reduced-product-preservation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-6.2.3b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\\)</span> (Horn sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1e5b78bfb3887990\" href=\"?note=1e5b78bfb3887990\" title=\"17-df-horn-formula\">17-df-horn-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L\\)</span> (reduced-product preservation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3979795456a966f2\" href=\"?note=3979795456a966f2\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product-preservation\">17-df-reduced-product-preservation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\n\\to\n\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L(\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{HornSent}_L\n\\to\n\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L(\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Expanding the conclusion with <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3979795456a966f2\" href=\"?note=3979795456a966f2\" title=\"17-df-reduced-product-preservation\">17-df-reduced-product-preservation</a> gives the correct one-way statement: if every factor satisfies a Horn sentence, then the reduced product over any proper filter satisfies it.</li>\n<li>Full truth equivalence for arbitrary first-order formulas requires an ultrafilter and is Łoś's theorem, not a theorem about general reduced products.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-horn-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1e5b78bfb3887990","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-horn-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"3979795456a966f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduced-product-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-horn-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1e5b78bfb3887990","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{HornSent}_L$ (Horn sentences, see [[17-df-horn-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"3979795456a966f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ReducedProductPreserved}_L$ (reduced-product preservation, see [[17-df-reduced-product-preservation]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduced-product-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"3979795456a966f2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Expanding the conclusion with [[17-df-reduced-product-preservation]] g